DOCKER BUILD & PUSH:
The workflow MUST include an additional job named "docker" to build and push a Docker image to Docker Hub.
{% if analysis.build_command or analysis.test_command %}
This job runs AFTER all CI jobs (`needs: [build]` or `needs: [test]` or `needs: [build, test]`).
{% else %}
Since there are no CI jobs, this job runs directly (do NOT include a `needs:` key).
{% endif %}

Docker job structure:
  docker:
    name: 'Docker Build & Push'
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
{% if analysis.build_command or analysis.test_command %}
    needs: <list of CI job names defined above>
{% endif %}
    steps:
    - uses: actions/checkout@v4
{% if analysis.publish_dir or analysis.build_command %}
    - name: Download build artifact
      uses: actions/download-artifact@v4
      with:
        name: 'build-output'
        path: '{{ analysis.publish_dir or "dist" }}'
{% endif %}
    - uses: docker/login-action@v3
      with:
        username: {% raw %}${{ secrets.DOCKERHUB_USERNAME }}{% endraw %}
        password: {% raw %}${{ secrets.DOCKERHUB_PASSWORD }}{% endraw %}
    - uses: docker/build-push-action@v5
      with:
        context: .
{% if analysis.dockerfile_path %}
        file: {{ analysis.dockerfile_path }}
{% endif %}
        push: true
        tags: |
          {% raw %}${{ secrets.DOCKERHUB_USERNAME }}{% endraw %}/{{ analysis.image_name }}:{% raw %}${{ github.sha }}{% endraw %}
          {% raw %}${{ secrets.DOCKERHUB_USERNAME }}{% endraw %}/{{ analysis.image_name }}:latest

CRITICAL RULES:
- Include ONLY steps for which specific commands or actions are defined above.
- If Working Directory is specified above, add `working-directory: <Working Directory>` to install, build, and test steps.
- Do NOT generate dummy steps, `echo` commands, or placeholder steps if runtime setup or caching is omitted above.
- Do NOT generate duplicate steps or duplicate commands. If no install command is provided, do NOT generate an install step.
- Use modern official action versions (@v4, @v5). Do NOT invent action names.
- Do NOT generate test steps unless a Test Command is explicitly provided above.
- If actions/upload-artifact@v4 is used, path MUST match the exact Build Output Directory provided above ({{ analysis.publish_dir or 'dist' }}). NEVER publish the workspace root (`.`).
- The Docker job MUST always download the build-output artifact before running docker/build-push-action@v5.
- The Docker job MUST always be included and MUST depend on the CI jobs.
- Every step must have a clear `name:` attribute.
- Keep the workflow clean, minimal, and production-ready.

